VERDICT: rigidity holds on |S|<=4, k<=10  ==>  True
  Every B(S)>=0 flip set has a CERTIFIED interior zero (winding>=1).
  Combined with the IVT half (B(S)<0), EVERY nonempty finite flip set
  on this family acquires a zero in the open disk. No counterexample.
